# Cloudflare Pages headers (perf audit 2026-08-05).
#
# When you deploy this site to Cloudflare Pages (pages.cloudflare.com),
# this file is read at deploy time and applied as HTTP headers on each
# response. It mirrors the rules we had in vercel.json so the perf wins
# survive the host switch.
#
# What each block does:
#
# 1. /_assets/* (1 year, immutable)
#    Built JS/CSS bundles have hashed filenames (e.g. hoisted.B8eB_Wxr.js).
#    The hash changes when the content does, so 1-year cache is safe —
#    the browser will get the new file the moment we ship a new hash.
#    "immutable" tells the browser "this URL never changes content, never
#    revalidate" which removes a network round-trip on repeat visits.
#
# 2. /fonts/* (1 year, immutable)
#    We self-host variable fonts (Inter-VF.woff2, Orbitron-VF.woff2,
#    JetBrainsMono-VF.woff2). They never change for the lifetime of a
#    deployment, so 1-year immutable cache is the right call.
#
# 3. /images/* (1 year, immutable)
#    Project thumbnails, profile.svg, etc. Same logic as fonts.
#
# 4. /favicon.svg, /favicon.ico (1 year, immutable)
#    Favicons rarely change; cache aggressively.
#
# 5. /*.html (must-revalidate)
#    The HTML pages MUST be revalidated on every visit so users see
#    updates immediately. "max-age=0" forces the browser to send a
#    conditional request (If-None-Match) which is cheap — just a 304
#    Not Modified response if nothing changed.
#
# 6. /* (security headers)
#    X-Content-Type-Options: prevents MIME sniffing attacks.
#    Referrer-Policy: only send the origin (not full URL) when leaving.
#    X-Frame-Options: block embedding in iframes (clickjacking protection).
#    Permissions-Policy: disable camera, mic, geolocation — site doesn't
#    use them, so we hard-block them as a privacy + security win.
#
# Format reference: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers

/_assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/images/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/favicon.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/favicon.ico
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
